    "text": "For **not**, put *-mA* before `-ýAr`: *gelmeýärdim*, I wasn't coming. For a question, put the particle **before** `-dY`: *Sen uklaýarmydyň?* Were you sleeping? A helper verb can take `-dY` too: *Men kitap okap otyrdym*, I was (sitting) reading.",
    "see": "gp-compound-tenses"
  },
